# Route guides maintenance

Whenever you **implement or materially change** a page, section, or feature in **`src/`**, update the matching guide under **`docs/guides/routes/`** in the **same change**.

## Which file to update

Mirror the SvelteKit URL (omit dynamic param values). Index: **`docs/guides/routes/README.md`**.

| Route | Guide |
| ----- | ----- |
| `/dashboard` | `docs/guides/routes/dashboard.md` |
| `/loans`, `/loans/[id]` | `docs/guides/routes/loans.md`, `loans-detail.md` |
| `/investors` | `docs/guides/routes/investors.md` |
| `/sign/[token]` | `docs/guides/routes/sign.md` |

Workflow: **`.agent/skills/route-guides/SKILL.md`**.

## What to document

Behavior, load/actions, validation, permissions (admin vs investor), edge cases, implementation map (Svelte + server paths).

## When guides need no change

Typos, internal renames with no UX/API/validation change.
